WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.341
Detecting defects is a core vision task, but
existing methods are demanding.

00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:09.764
One-class approaches need a bank of normal images
per product;

00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:13.901
CLIP-based zero-shot methods rely on hand-written prompts.

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:15.898
Many factories have neither.

00:00:15.978 --> 00:00:20.820
The goal: segment anomalies with no training,
prompts, or references.
